@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+This file describes API changes in the tool_customlang code.
+
+=== 6.0 ===
+
+* The constant tool_customlang_utils::ROUGH_NUMBER_OF_STRINGS has been deprecated and is no longer used. The
+  checkout progress is now computed from the actual number of components and strings being processed, so that
+  the progress bar never reaches 100% before the checkout has actually finished (MDL-89494).
